### getplaneinfo 实现要点

```c
static int mylcd_getplaneinfo(FAR struct lcd_dev_s *dev,
                              unsigned int planeno,
                              FAR struct lcd_planeinfo_s *pinfo)
{
  DEBUGASSERT(dev && pinfo && planeno == 0);
  memcpy(pinfo, &g_planeinfo, sizeof(struct lcd_planeinfo_s));

