- [x] Preserve I2S1 TX pins/rate/transport and the existing 3:2 resampler.
- [x] Preserve Wi-Fi, SMP, OLED, PWM, robotctl, boot, flash, and PSRAM.
- [x] Reject partial DMA descriptor setup and preserve normal callback/APB
