From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] ai_agent: serialize network services and guard request JSON

The ESP32-S3 board build applies this compatibility patch only while building.
It makes the already-connected and reconnect startup paths converge on one
mutex-protected transition, after the NSH CLI is ready. It also turns cJSON
allocation failures on the ask path into normal errors rather than null-object
dereferences, with concise stage diagnostics for hardware validation.

